## Interface: 16001
## Title: Velocity
## Notes: Split tracker and auto-generated leveling guide in one. Times your levels, quests, kills, professions and money against your best runs or an imported reference - on an Active clock that stops when you walk away, so real-life interruptions don't count. Reminds you when a profession can be trained and shows the next milestone of the run you are chasing.
## Author: Kuro
## Version: dev
## SavedVariables: VelocitySplitTrackerDB, SplitTimerDB
## OptionalDeps: LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0, LibDataBroker-1.1, LibDBIcon-1.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\VelocitySplitTracker\Assets\VelocitySplitTracker_Icon.tga
## X-Website: https://github.com/WoWAddons-Kuro/VelocitySplitTracker

